zone xml:id="m-6b21cd24-ea72-4bf0-9190-1595b47d887f" ulx="505" uly="1494" lrx="778" lry="1533" /><zone xml:id="m-a9840a99-ab23-45b3-a318-a72dac979370" ulx="35" uly="1495" lrx="445" lry="1532" /></surface></facsimile><body>
    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-3420e6cb-a70a-4ebe-8c80-ab9feb683d99" n="0111" facs="#m-5c4d3d12-0732-414a-8989-6f15239dbfbd" /><div xml:id="m-37e77062-c02d-4c6f-b7d3-f7826682df61">
            <lg xml:id="m-fba08c9c-b3bb-4b92-ad90-dfb6cae03224">
              <l xml:id="m-e2c24529-184b-472e-8d4e-0bdce8a88271" facs="#m-0816513a-530b-423a-9a09-aebd06189f25" label="text-like">THE ORDINARY OF THE MASS.</l><l xml:id="m-e106418a-afa0-4a85-be09-6ba175cacbcd" facs="#m-64e244ca-c84f-47ff-affb-26353ac0d907" label="lyrics-like">The Priest : In nómine Pátris, etl</l><l xml:id="m-a1738c88-5c55-4dc0-8562-791604e18b2d" facs="#m-10342311-c92b-4eec-b776-e88351af80df" label="lyrics-like">P. Confiteor Déo omnipoténti, etc.</l><l xml:id="m-57eedaa9-28fd-4580-8406-ef715e2eefef" facs="#m-62bc0999-75f9-4b25-9b99-8b721008e531" label="lyrics-like">Fíli, et Spfritus Sáncti. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-92274c52-bd88-46b1-843e-08cb3a02afc0" facs="#m-629368a9-2f10-47f5-aa28-e421c2f031c3" label="text-like">The Servers:</l><l xml:id="m-bd830c80-90d1-449e-a4bb-a1fa48515afa" facs="#m-06682672-a5ed-4227-b658-55eb36023411" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Introsbo ad altáre Déi.</l><l xml:id="m-a41e78a1-eb82-44eb-b4d0-ed073486f822" facs="#m-5d4d2b39-e0ce-4739-b90b-fd6826d416f0" label="lyrics-like">Misereátur túi omnípotens Déus,</l><l xml:id="m-f220b6b2-4056-4ba4-93e9-ea921b5133d7" facs="#m-db774d38-ee33-481a-bb7c-dbab5a03b60d" label="lyrics-like">The Servers: R. Ad Déum qui</l><l xml:id="m-a1c2aced-11b8-4986-b2f9-281351b307a1" facs="#m-3be3b8d5-4f41-4290-92c9-2112156500b6" label="lyrics-like">laetificat juventutem méam.</l><l xml:id="m-8b61184c-7494-4ea6-a623-1f1646a7a753" facs="#m-d4b444f2-d9d0-4d7f-b4b6-5489d60c096b" label="lyrics-like">et dimissis peccátis túis, perdúcat te</l><l xml:id="m-7d871c86-1680-4c8a-8a3c-ae6f0f8e7ba1" facs="#m-f65224f0-5ca0-419f-ab24-26b5f943255d" label="lyrics-like">ad vitam aetérnam. — P. K. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-7c1a311d-dcb6-4fb4-9121-c41faef08f7d" facs="#m-49cdebe6-6b21-4026-9217-ad8180989610" label="ambiguous">Psalm 42.</l><l xml:id="m-32d3f003-a2aa-4a90-a444-71e93caae894" facs="#m-3beb2d31-bdf4-4660-96e6-dee417d96f7e" label="text-like">The Servers:</l><l xml:id="m-9770d154-fed5-4b1b-b9d8-91cc5928ff45" facs="#m-4df80c07-603f-4283-b143-47b4113e14fd" label="lyrics-like">[Udica me Déus, et discérne cáu¬</l><l xml:id="m-efc4df66-bfb7-41d3-9fc8-24f7cffc63ae" facs="#m-79aca408-d280-49de-a306-5462d813739e" label="lyrics-like">sam méam de génte non sán¬</l><l xml:id="m-de652220-13b6-455e-ab75-78d41667762b" facs="#m-e01632b9-94ee-4557-b528-75e471dd9c8d" label="lyrics-like">Confiteor Déo omnipoténti, beá¬</l><l xml:id="m-62448e5c-9089-4ee3-b400-99bbbde6b26d" facs="#m-4ee6791f-69ca-4d30-b1cb-53ea5a906430" label="lyrics-like">cta: ab hómine iniquo et dolóso</l><l xml:id="m-39904b29-a7e8-48ce-a7af-4abeb08cdbbc" facs="#m-a1081dcc-2097-421e-bb4a-d3375da068a2" label="lyrics-like">tae Maríae semper Virgini, beáto</l><l xml:id="m-f212c9c0-b8d1-4aa0-a3f9-49824b358721" facs="#m-34b4ebe8-d6a8-4c28-9048-73e543e237f0" label="lyrics-like">érue me.</l><l xml:id="m-7302b3e1-b0ed-4d7d-8e85-7fb48cbf8347" facs="#m-671a9ed0-a5a2-411a-b78f-03b462d0c0b7" label="lyrics-like">Michaéli Archángelo, beãto Joánni</l><l xml:id="m-d480398f-f8bc-4a56-8393-9c0bc92e2d89" facs="#m-701ef070-0e53-442d-862e-9d6733964907" label="lyrics-like">S. Quia tu es Déus fortitúdo méa:</l><l xml:id="m-937a5db2-0f4a-4b7f-86b6-ea3ce34332a5" facs="#m-00157d92-9c2c-4796-844b-aff001c829a2" label="lyrics-like">Baptístae, sanctis Apóstolis Pétro</l><l xml:id="m-c53e1cd7-d686-439d-985a-5868a288142f" facs="#m-cfb35924-fb47-49e7-be01-e5ec01b726e0" label="lyrics-like">et Paulo, ómnibus sánctis, et tibi</l><l xml:id="m-6d49eccf-8377-47f8-af87-78ea5322ffb4" facs="#m-94b01b50-cbea-45a0-820d-d5cd55baa4c5" label="lyrics-like">quare me repulísti, et quare tristis</l><l xml:id="m-7b5bb240-788b-48d6-846d-fae6d40e97f0" facs="#m-2ee81f68-e3e7-4394-95e2-648ea8035990" label="lyrics-like">incédo, dum affligit me inimicus?</l><l xml:id="m-b09a3db4-fe30-40e3-9816-ca3124a7677f" facs="#m-6dfc73ac-9c25-4aa6-a0e9-c33bf93b514a" label="lyrics-like">páter, quia peccávi nimis cogita¬</l><l xml:id="m-6f7151ec-7285-432d-943b-01f2df5a02d4" facs="#m-b4aca198-3ef7-40de-b7fd-2ed4cddd3377" label="lyrics-like">tióne, vérbo et ópere: méa cúlpa,</l><l xml:id="m-f8aa0f27-8985-4a5c-9352-15cac3a070de" facs="#m-4670689f-df3d-4d5b-9696-b172bf02d892" label="lyrics-like">P. Emitte lúcem túam, et veritá¬</l><l xml:id="m-65deca86-7172-4d4d-8725-6058d8d08063" facs="#m-215a0745-9507-4583-ba46-cb2ec530c172" label="lyrics-like">méa culpa, méa máxima cúlpa. Ideo</l><l xml:id="m-698ed2f9-bd68-4765-9af9-9d876c0501a3" facs="#m-08563ec4-452d-40a9-8172-24899468afc8" label="lyrics-like">tem túam : ipsa me deduxérunt, et</l><l xml:id="m-7e9094bc-68a1-46c0-99c1-25fbbdc36fb8" facs="#m-a855646a-f982-4cb3-b702-a7ffde4ff049" label="lyrics-like">précor beátam Maríam semper Vir¬</l><l xml:id="m-c4d230c3-033f-4869-a25f-e2c09d9c878a" facs="#m-dd0973dc-bbd1-4d94-9639-15c3eeee4436" label="lyrics-like">adduxérunt in móntem sánctum</l><l xml:id="m-b35eb626-12e0-4475-8141-e739ff258d0b" facs="#m-13eaffd7-15cd-4d3d-b170-109f33e94f3c" label="lyrics-like">ginem, beátum Michaélem Archán¬</l><l xml:id="m-0ad5bae8-f4f6-44ba-b7d6-b3b1115967b8" facs="#m-44729c87-9fa0-422d-8135-b89c37d140bd" label="lyrics-like">túum et in tabernácula túa.</l><l xml:id="m-afafc67e-1304-4302-a4a4-8a3c351ebeeb" facs="#m-cac7ae5a-bac9-4240-bdcb-60eae42409ad" label="lyrics-like">gelum, beátum Joánnem Baptistam,</l><l xml:id="m-b5b7b262-e1d2-4216-82c6-4f5cbccee250" facs="#m-b58ea64b-951d-44a3-b59a-33602bdc2418" label="lyrics-like">S. Et introibo ad altáre Déi</l><l xml:id="m-d4841c51-6972-4d0e-a850-cbcd11b6c64c" facs="#m-eb74cc96-5da6-4da8-b4aa-01f8fc5a1b5d" label="lyrics-like">sánctos Apóstolos Pétrum et Páu¬</l><l xml:id="m-1d49f0dc-3288-4706-a78b-8eaa9547df53" facs="#m-99ffd1ed-8d4b-4efc-9d25-a1340b85496b" label="lyrics-like">ad Déum qui laetfficat juventutem</l><l xml:id="m-71f9a31f-a2af-401a-b90f-38ec5eff41e5" facs="#m-23379292-3ad3-44aa-a528-83e6f3b96585" label="lyrics-like">lum, omnes sánctos, et te páter,</l><l xml:id="m-ede479ea-766c-4c7d-a46e-56c54d3306b2" facs="#m-8905dff2-59d9-40d6-a97a-56556027cd69" label="lyrics-like">méam.</l><l xml:id="m-808cf26e-098a-4db0-81b9-c486ec4b78cb" facs="#m-aad076ca-0f6a-4998-a3f6-91cd5c04d8ca" label="lyrics-like">oráre pro me ad Dóminum Déum</l><l xml:id="m-40214c35-ca76-477c-8775-41930545984f" facs="#m-8f3bf03e-b41e-41ff-89a0-5c29d9c595d0" label="lyrics-like">P. Confitébor tibi in cithara,</l><l xml:id="m-337d6570-13c0-475e-aab3-18f65a90d1d3" facs="#m-3c342e30-f9ab-498c-81bc-5ded608903e6" label="lyrics-like">nóstrum.</l><l xml:id="m-823ae624-222b-4039-b664-2796fe9dfcbb" facs="#m-c81b0d41-ebf9-4498-9b9d-d30a1780543b" label="lyrics-like">Déus, Déus méus : quare tristis es</l><l xml:id="m-2af523a0-fa7f-4c10-91e9-55583d16f906" facs="#m-3496b45a-010b-4b79-ba23-c5c2b23687e6" label="text-like">The Priest:</l><l xml:id="m-44b8134e-77fb-499e-8430-4c4fbc7ad2e9" facs="#m-ec9ab75a-88c9-4e8a-90a2-97c9b6018fbd" label="lyrics-like">ánima méa, et quare contúrbas me?</l><l xml:id="m-212c0022-3c09-4d97-8004-b4ab9d2b828b" facs="#m-9cf79dea-c86c-49b3-8607-92fb34b26be6" label="lyrics-like">Misereátur véstri omnipotens</l><l xml:id="m-164b45f8-709d-4114-a617-4b60face4d1a" facs="#m-9fb3742e-e921-44be-a2ac-2af5ceec9025" label="lyrics-like">S. Spéra in Déo, quóniam adhuc</l><l xml:id="m-8d7bcc85-4352-4b81-8dba-c544b445e2b2" facs="#m-68b60e77-85f0-4f69-9e67-0ec47a9e54ff" label="lyrics-like">Déus, et dimíssis peccátis véstris,</l><l xml:id="m-531eab59-3a1f-4d29-bb84-a93155f0e3b6" facs="#m-6766b3b5-fe48-45a1-a384-45d87b914b2e" label="lyrics-like">confitébor illi : salutãre vúltus méi,</l><l xml:id="m-c9af96f4-6f8d-41c9-84dc-e9e93c139edc" facs="#m-e8615611-3c71-4a72-a2b3-f8ae9819a115" label="lyrics-like">perdúcat vos ad vitam aetérnam.</l><l xml:id="m-4b0efef4-679d-415d-be0e-2c1a9b45b453" facs="#m-578e2b02-5708-4dee-9b93-c03ae3154cb5" label="lyrics-like">et Déus méus.</l><l xml:id="m-f280dddc-b507-413b-b75a-226ab6a6b1ba" facs="#m-ac7ed990-56d5-4d79-a0b5-3e1f63130a47" label="ambiguous">R. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-fc0ad016-313a-4cbf-b590-cb92416fb382" facs="#m-f714fcac-d802-4833-9671-1787b81c909d" label="lyrics-like">P. Glória Pátri, et Filio, et Spi¬</l><l xml:id="m-6b18ef5e-9b81-4b80-94bb-aae7298810e2" facs="#m-53e59256-cd75-4d7f-ba31-0bba40d58504" label="lyrics-like">Indulgéntiam, absolutiónem et</l><l xml:id="m-27f44eb5-260e-4ca3-8cd7-fc325fa29410" facs="#m-945e7152-2a31-4fc2-95b9-758e26e608b2" label="ambiguous">ritui Sancto.</l><l xml:id="m-21ae1703-5f70-4aa8-8b1e-f3e0aabfcb24" facs="#m-d1963eba-8d71-4a2d-b824-048199170099" label="lyrics-like">remissiónem peccatórum nostrórum</l><l xml:id="m-911307b9-f464-4404-840f-f08fe4a19588" facs="#m-1c304360-daa6-45f1-a01b-cdcddd7cbac7" label="lyrics-like">S. Sicut érat in principio, et nunc,</l><l xml:id="m-c370bbf9-0cb5-455f-81ca-e4acfa68b86e" facs="#m-01c3914a-3182-48f1-ad06-bb549b6e250d" label="lyrics-like">tribuat nóbis omnipotens et miséri¬</l><l xml:id="m-12f93e42-279e-40a2-b808-93d64196ccf4" facs="#m-284be840-1e85-46ff-902e-43091f87341d" label="lyrics-like">et semper et in saécula saeculó¬</l><l xml:id="m-b2459349-1126-4e40-b0be-8e8f95b8151a" facs="#m-e48769e8-775c-4581-816c-cec6a4072bd3" label="lyrics-like">cors Dóminus. B. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-9a8fd29c-9fed-4eb2-8035-bf1afa40c786" facs="#m-a5b3c3e6-5f60-499a-a57d-f964f522ed81" label="ambiguous">rum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-45a80702-8401-46df-b48b-1a8069fefb2a" facs="#m-4b2f5503-819e-4b4b-a656-1097cbc5884a" label="lyrics-like">V. Déus tu convérsus vivificábis</l><l xml:id="m-98a6d9d4-7214-46a5-90ec-601dcc67e196" facs="#m-c303295f-66c4-41cc-a72e-6902b4a71a55" label="lyrics-like">P. Introibo ad altàre Déi.</l><l xml:id="m-979ff7f2-d9de-4b44-9171-7535fae35715" facs="#m-bfb58dbe-8c0d-43eb-aa16-b165dd7f2a31" label="lyrics-like">K. Ad Déum qui laetifficat ju¬</l><l xml:id="m-8d61ddf6-1880-4dac-900c-986d78f863fd" facs="#m-05bb0fd8-f0fb-4fc0-b26c-535b4104e17d" label="ambiguous">nos.</l><l xml:id="m-46958dd3-e083-4ed5-b6e4-96f4d854a87f" facs="#m-2b099c14-530b-462b-9f08-c371a9b87e70" label="lyrics-like">K. Et plebs túa laetábitur in te.</l><l xml:id="m-7f3ad1a7-2009-4c5f-8fe0-78340b6ec780" facs="#m-0c0792c2-5b55-49a2-b388-10d3bd7bcca7" label="lyrics-like">ventútem méam.</l><l xml:id="m-a5933516-365d-44eb-98fa-345f9a22f7ea" facs="#m-8e099861-7a1d-4806-8800-0ebc56b5dd85" label="lyrics-like">V. Adjutórium nóstrum in nómine</l><l xml:id="m-70467199-f63e-4ead-9d99-97a45790065a" facs="#m-eead9641-28a7-4e74-b4e6-78874ff2bfe1" label="lyrics-like">V. Osténde nóbis Dómine mise¬</l><l xml:id="m-b98995fa-eff1-47e9-9cef-3a28ce2323b0" facs="#m-c79e22d7-9c30-4ae4-a0ca-4b357fad79d5" label="lyrics-like">Dómini.</l><l xml:id="m-7284dea6-0450-43a0-9b95-b9aa19925e5a" facs="#m-48baa8e8-7446-4cc8-855c-10ef9c65cecb" label="lyrics-like">ricórdiam túam.</l><l xml:id="m-040a6f5a-4d8a-4061-9c12-c1c80713db89" facs="#m-e0888af0-ec64-4828-9d4a-6bd38fe53308" label="lyrics-like">R. Qui fécit caélum et térram.</l><l xml:id="m-eddd4cbf-148b-43eb-97c4-b4b6be5ba98d" facs="#m-76de0686-6010-4503-a34e-78b07ab18ddd" label="lyrics-like">g. Et salutáre túum da nóbis.</l><l xml:id="m-fa18149b-f79b-47db-b0a5-6c531a2c9347" facs="#m-5dd13240-5ec3-44b2-8eca-8f9ad5c885de" label="lyrics-like">V. Dómine exáudi oratiónem</l><l xml:id="m-e3cbc35c-1eab-483b-a21a-4bad7a3436c5" facs="#m-5a662272-4325-48e8-a66f-ac356ec1a5a8" label="text-like">In Masses for the Dead and in</l><l xml:id="m-8e9eaf25-d67c-4a5c-9011-6bb3ade212b8" facs="#m-6ac5560e-778e-4c32-858e-d1bd684ad3af" label="lyrics-like">méam.</l><l xml:id="m-762be9a3-4427-4525-8aa5-e77d0fa4d4fe" facs="#m-713418c6-a08f-481f-9406-171d9c5d8c20" label="text-like">Masses of the Time from Passion</l><l xml:id="m-35a23375-412e-4d24-874a-a09cb0ab4a16" facs="#m-f9643c65-e691-4aed-aa6b-04f059bebe00" label="lyrics-like">K. Et clámor méus ad te véniat.</l><l xml:id="m-ba9f30b5-4f97-40fc-bf1f-48092b543251" facs="#m-e7f7b5a6-e689-4fa4-87f2-ccc93506dcb7" label="text-like">Sunday to Holy Saturday exclusive,</l><l xml:id="m-cf9077ce-f516-4ad9-b573-a085330d3c93" facs="#m-abbc3443-8f81-44b0-bba0-854ab0b67a18" label="lyrics-like">the Psatm Júdica me is omitted, ana</l><l xml:id="m-d8dea28d-0339-4c43-a3e0-b2e723be485f" facs="#m-8c795121-c762-410d-b6d6-e8c455cfabed" label="lyrics-like">V. Dóminus vobiscum.</l><l xml:id="m-d778f558-5ae3-4554-bdea-71b9cb08a521" facs="#m-6b21cd24-ea72-4bf0-9190-1595b47d887f" label="lyrics-like">R. Et cum sptritu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-435e3900-92e9-466f-8892-934f34dd521a" facs="#m-a9840a99-ab23-45b3-a318-a72dac979370" label="text-like">also the repetition of the Antiphon.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>